                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "There are two data sets. First, observed time series of prices of carbon allowances in the EU-ETS. Second, simulated data on prices, emissions, banked emissions, auctioning, in various scenarios. The purpose of these scenarios is to compare those scenarios with cancellation rules as specified in the Market Stability Reserves, with scenarios without these cancellation rules."
